ver\\n    Server-->>Client: 200 OK (User Profile)\\n    deactivate Server\\n\\n    Client->>Server: POST /api/profiles/{username}/follow\\n    activate Server\\n    Server-->>Client: 200 OK (Updated Profile with following=true)\\n    deactivate Server\\n\\n    Client->>Server: DELETE /api/profiles/{username}/follow\\n    activate Server\\n    Server-->>Client: 200 OK (Updated Profile with following=false)\\n    deactivate Server\\n```\\n\\nThis tutorial provides a basic understanding of how to manage user profiles and implement a following system. You can expand upon this by adding features like listing followers/following or personalized feeds.\\n\'}}}]'}]}, {'role': <MessageRole.USER: 'user'>, 'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': 'Observation:\nSuccessfully wrote to 04_profile_and_following.md'}]}], stop=['Observation:', 'Calling tools:'], tools=[{'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'read_codebase_file', 'description': 'Read a UTF-8 text file inside the target codebase (Truncated at 500 lines).', 'parameters': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'file_path': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Relative path inside the codebase directory.'}}, 'required': ['file_path']}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'list_codebase_directory', 'description': 'List entries within a directory. Raises error if path is a file.', 'parameters': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'dir_path': {'type': 'string', 'nullable': True, 'description': 'Relative directory path to inspect. Defaults to current directory.'}}, 'required': []}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'write_workspace_file', 'description': 'Write content to a file in the sub-agent workspace.', 'parameters': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'file_path': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Relative path inside the workspace where content is written.'}, 'content': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Text to write into the file.'}, 'append': {'type': 'boolean', 'nullable': True, 'description': 'When True, ap